# Archivos y carpetas a ignorar en el build de Docker

# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/testpublish/

# VS Code
.vscode/
.vs/

# Git
.git/
.gitignore

# Node modules (si no se necesitan en el backend)
**/node_modules/

# Tests
**/test-results/
**/*.trx

# Documentation
*.md
!README.md

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Temporary files
**/*.swp
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp

# Logs
**/*.log

# Azure Pipelines
azure-pipelines*.yml

# Docker
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

# Scripts
*.bat
*.sh

# Coverage
**/coverage/

# Cypress
**/cypress/
cypress.config.js
